        "stigmaRules.verdict (v1): No 2-source slot-by-level order. GamesFuze+Skycoach agree TD then IC as top two (supports app slots 1-2; these are priority lists, so equip timing is inferred). Slots 3-4: Metabot+Skycoach put Swift Contract before Savage Fang; GamesFuze the reverse. The app follows the majority (SC 32 / SF 37). Same four stigmas in all three sources (2-source+).",
        "Upgrade priority (v1): Triniel's Dagger to 10 and Illusive Clone to 20 (GamesFuze + Skycoach, 2-source). App plan 'all to 5, then slot 1 to 10/15' is Metabot general advice (single).",
