        "specialtyPicks (0.3 E7, docs/research/2026-10-specialty-picks.md, merged as #77 at 8dd047d): position = slot (1, 2, 3). Slots 2 and 3 carry only picks the research labels 2+ sources for that slot (Heart Gore 4 / 5, Quick Slice 4 / 5), each listed in specialtyEvidence with its slot witnesses (the generator checks this). The other contested, disputed, single-source and gap slots were left out (\"pick a specialty\", design Q6) until 0.8.1 F2 (below). GamesFuze is not slot-ordered, so it is no slot witness. Metabot lists the choices but no picks.",
